=== GeneralCarrier.lean:188 theorem main_result  HEADLINE
DOC 183: /-- **THE MAIN RESULT.** (i) For every nonempty finite observable system, exact finite
DOC 184: endomorphic quantum mechanics is characterized exactly by the five physical completion
DOC 185: conditions; (ii) the conditions are jointly satisfiable; (iii) on the qubit, each condition
DOC 186: is independent of the other four and of OI realization (the five-way audit); (iv) OI alone
DOC 187: does not select QM. No external boundary item enters any clause. -/
SIG 188: theorem main_result :
SIG 189:     (∀ (A : Type) [Fintype A] [DecidableEq A] [Nonempty A] (T : FiniteOperationalTheory A),
SIG 190:       ExactAllFiniteEndomorphicQuantumOps T ↔ PhysicalCompletionConditions T)
SIG 191:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2), PhysicalCompletionConditions T)
SIG 192:     ∧ ((∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 193:       InertSpectatorCompositionality T ∧ HasCompositeUnitaryControl T
SIG 194:         ∧ IteratedAncillaClosure T ∧ SystemToLevelOne T ∧ RealizesSealedOICore T
SIG 195:         ∧ ¬ CompositeOperationalValidity T)
SIG 196:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 197:       CompositeOperationalValidity T ∧ HasCompositeUnitaryControl T
SIG 198:         ∧ IteratedAncillaClosure T ∧ SystemToLevelOne T ∧ RealizesSealedOICore T
SIG 199:         ∧ ¬ InertSpectatorCompositionality T)
SIG 200:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 201:       CompositeOperationalValidity T ∧ InertSpectatorCompositionality T
SIG 202:         ∧ IteratedAncillaClosure T ∧ SystemToLevelOne T ∧ RealizesSealedOICore T
SIG 203:         ∧ ¬ HasCompositeUnitaryControl T)
SIG 204:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 205:       CompositeOperationalValidity T ∧ InertSpectatorCompositionality T
SIG 206:         ∧ HasCompositeUnitaryControl T ∧ SystemToLevelOne T ∧ RealizesSealedOICore T
SIG 207:         ∧ ¬ IteratedAncillaClosure T)
SIG 208:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 209:       CompositeOperationalValidity T ∧ InertSpectatorCompositionality T
SIG 210:         ∧ HasCompositeUnitaryControl T ∧ IteratedAncillaClosure T ∧ RealizesSealedOICore T
SIG 211:         ∧ ¬ SystemToLevelOne T))
SIG 212:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 213:       RealizesSealedOICore T ∧ ¬ ExactAllFiniteEndomorphicQuantumOps T) :=
