=== CarrierGeneralOIPlus.lean:185 def OIPlus  HEADLINE
DOC 181: /-- **OI⁺ ON A CARRIER**: well-formedness, observational independence, reversible richness,
DOC 182: observer recursion. The sealed qubit core is not a statement about a general carrier; on the
DOC 183: qubit its conjunct is redundant (`completedOI_iff_physical`) and `oiPlus_qubit_iff` below
DOC 184: identifies this definition with the round-53 one. -/
SIG 185: def OIPlus : Prop :=
SIG 186:   WellFormed T ∧ ObservationalIndependence T ∧ ReversibleRichness T ∧ ObserverRecursion T
