=== ImplementationLocality.lean:352 def ImplementationGenerated  HEADLINE
DOC 349: /-- **(G) IMPLEMENTATION GENERATION**: at every positive level, availability is instrument
DOC 350: realization by the class. The normalization half of validity is a theorem of the predicate
DOC 351: (`instAvail_trace`), not a clause. -/
SIG 352: def ImplementationGenerated (T : FiniteOperationalTheory A) (𝓘 : ImplementationClass) : Prop :=
SIG 353:   ∀ (N : ℕ), 0 < N → ∀ (O : Type) [Fintype O] [DecidableEq O]
SIG 354:     (F : O → Matrix (A × Fin N) (A × Fin N) ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] Matrix (A × Fin N) (A × Fin N) ℂ),
