DOC 357: /-- **(C) CONTEXT STABILITY**: adjoining uncoupled degrees of freedom leaves an admissible
DOC 358: implementation admissible, unchanged on its original support. -/
SIG 359: def ContextStable (𝓘 : ImplementationClass) : Prop :=
SIG 360:   ∀ (R S : Type) [Fintype R] [DecidableEq R] [Fintype S] [DecidableEq S] (K : Matrix S S ℂ),
SIG 361:     𝓘 S K → 𝓘 (R × S) (tensorOf (1 : Matrix R R ℂ) K)
