=== MicroscopicReversibility.lean:93 def LieRankRichness  HEADLINE
DOC 92: /-- **LIE-RANK RICHNESS**: the drift/control certificate at every level. -/
SIG 93: def LieRankRichness : Prop :=
SIG 94:   ∀ n : ℕ, ∃ (G : Type) (H : Matrix (A × Fin n) (A × Fin n) ℂ)
SIG 95:     (U : G → Matrix (A × Fin n) (A × Fin n) ℂ),
SIG 96:     Hᴴ = H ∧ (∀ g, (U g)ᴴ * U g = 1) ∧ HControl H U
SIG 97:       ∧ (∀ t : ℝ, T.availExt n Unit (fun _ => conjChannel (flow H t)))
SIG 98:       ∧ (∀ g, T.availExt n Unit (fun _ => conjChannel (U g)))
