=== MicroscopicReversibility.lean:238 def UnitaryRaySaturated  HEADLINE
DOC 232: /-- **UNITARY-RAY SATURATION**: a class that contains a nonzero scalar multiple of a unitary
DOC 233: contains the unitary. It is a statement about admissible operators, not about the phase
DOC 234: resource of a theory; the four classes of the kernel have it, the closed-form class of the
DOC 235: countercontrol (`InstrumentRealization`) does not. It enters at exactly one place, the
DOC 236: derivation of inverse accessibility from dagger stability, and no equivalence package
DOC 237: carries it. -/
SIG 238: def UnitaryRaySaturated (𝓘 : ImplementationClass) : Prop :=
SIG 239:   ∀ (S : Type) [Fintype S] [DecidableEq S] (c : ℂ) (V : Matrix S S ℂ), c ≠ 0 → Vᴴ * V = 1 →
SIG 240:     𝓘 S (c • V) → 𝓘 S V
