DOC 196: /-- **THE FLOW IS THE MISSING OPERATOR.** Bijective dynamics supplies the state exchanges and the
DOC 197: phase structure supplies the phases — both monomial — but the continuously driven transition,
DOC 198: whose nontrivial flow values are not monomial (`rot` as witness), is the operation neither
DOC 199: supplies. -/
