=== ReadWriteControl.lean:86 structure ReadWriteFamily  HEADLINE
DOC 82: /-- **A READ-WRITE FAMILY**: a selectable local coupling. For each external parameter value
DOC 83: `λ`, a bijection of the finite state set (the reversible substratum evolution, A2); `λ = 0` is
DOC 84: the reference interaction; the modification is local — every state outside the coupled pair
DOC 85: `{a, b}` is left fixed. -/
SIG 86: structure ReadWriteFamily (a b : S) where
SIG 87:   couple : ℝ → Equiv.Perm S
SIG 88:   reference : couple 0 = 1
SIG 89:   local_support : ∀ (l : ℝ) (x : S), x ≠ a → x ≠ b → couple l x = x
