=== ReadWriteControl.lean:188 def memorySwap  HEADLINE
DOC 186: /-- **THE MEMORY-SWAP FAMILY**: a genuine nontrivial reversible read-write dynamics that
DOC 187: exchanges two states — bidirectional hidden memory — with the reference at `λ = 0`. -/
SIG 188: noncomputable def memorySwap (a b : S) : ReadWriteFamily a b where
SIG 189:   couple := fun l => if l = 0 then 1 else Equiv.swap a b
SIG 190:   reference := by simp
SIG 191:   local_support := by
SIG 192:     intro l x hxa hxb
SIG 193:     by_cases hl : l = 0
SIG 194:     · simp [hl]
SIG 195:     · simp only [hl, if_false]
SIG 196:       exact Equiv.swap_apply_of_ne_of_ne hxa hxb
