DOC 76: /-- **T1 — THE SIGN-FLIP IDENTITY.** The gate flow, times the time-reversed gate flow conjugated
DOC 77: by the sign flip at the image of the chosen configuration, is the transition flow on the chosen
DOC 78: pair at angle `π t`: on that pair the sign reverses the rotation of the reversed flow and leaves
DOC 79: its scalar, so the rotations add and the scalars cancel; on every other moved pair the flow meets
DOC 80: its inverse; on the fixed configurations nothing moves. No continuous phase enters. -/
