=== LiftAudit.lean:338 def orb  HEADLINE
DOC 334: /-- **AN ORBIT MATRIX** of an involution: `A z` on the diagonal, `B z` at `(τ z, z)` when `z` is
DOC 335: moved, and nothing else. Permutation matrices of the involution, diagonal matrices, the gate flows
DOC 336: and the transition flows on a moved pair are all of this form, and the form is closed under
DOC 337: products. -/
SIG 338: def orb (A B : S → ℂ) : Matrix S S ℂ :=
SIG 339:   Matrix.of fun y z => (if y = z then A z else 0) + (if τ z ≠ z ∧ y = τ z then B z else 0)
