DOC 656: /-- **THE ISOLATION IDENTITY.** The phase, the gate flow, and the gate flow conjugated by the
DOC 657: sign of the non-chosen orbits multiply to the transition flow on the chosen pair at angle `πt`:
DOC 658: on every other moved orbit the two rotations cancel, on the fixed configurations nothing moves,
DOC 659: and the phase removes the scalar the cancellation leaves. -/
SIG 660: theorem gateFlow_isolation (hτ : ∀ z, τ (τ z) = z) {a : S} (ha : τ a ≠ a)
SIG 661:     (e : S ≃ Fin (Fintype.card S)) (t : ℝ) :
SIG 662:     Matrix.diagonal (phaseFun τ t) * gateFlow τ t
SIG 663:         * (Matrix.diagonal (signFun τ e a) * gateFlow τ t * Matrix.diagonal (signFun τ e a))
SIG 664:       = ReachabilitySeam.flow (transition a (τ a)) (Real.pi * t) := by
