=== EmbeddedObservation.lean:93 abbrev TheoryFamily
DOC 92: /-- A finite operational theory at every finite carrier. -/
SIG 93: abbrev TheoryFamily :=
SIG 94:   ∀ (S : Type) [Fintype S] [DecidableEq S], FiniteOperationalTheory S
=== EmbeddedObservation.lean:98 def RegroupingInvariant  HEADLINE
DOC 96: /-- **(R) REGROUPING INVARIANCE**: the positive-level families of the observer at `S` are the
DOC 97: system families of the observer at the regrouped carrier `S × Fin m`. -/
SIG 98: def RegroupingInvariant (𝒯 : TheoryFamily) : Prop :=
SIG 99:   ∀ (S : Type) [Fintype S] [DecidableEq S] (m : ℕ), 0 < m →
SIG 100:     ∀ (O : Type) [Fintype O] [DecidableEq O]
SIG 101:       (F : O → Matrix (S × Fin m) (S × Fin m) ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] Matrix (S × Fin m) (S × Fin m) ℂ),
SIG 102:       (𝒯 S).availExt m O F ↔ (𝒯 (S × Fin m)).avail O F
=== EmbeddedObservation.lean:106 def RelabellingInvariant  HEADLINE
DOC 104: /-- **(L) RELABELLING INVARIANCE**: availability is transported along every bijection of
DOC 105: carriers. -/
SIG 106: def RelabellingInvariant (𝒯 : TheoryFamily) : Prop :=
SIG 107:   ∀ (S S' : Type) [Fintype S] [DecidableEq S] [Fintype S'] [DecidableEq S'] (e : S ≃ S')
SIG 108:     (O : Type) [Fintype O] [DecidableEq O] (F : O → Matrix S S ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] Matrix S S ℂ),
SIG 109:     (𝒯 S).avail O F → (𝒯 S').avail O (fun a => transport e (F a))
=== EmbeddedObservation.lean:114 def IsAmbientMember  HEADLINE
DOC 111: /-- **(M) AMBIENCE**: `T` is the family's member at its own carrier, on the system and at
DOC 112: every positive level. Only the positive-level clause is consumed by the recursion derivation;
DOC 113: the system clause is consumed by the level-one seam. -/
SIG 114: def IsAmbientMember (T : FiniteOperationalTheory A) (𝒯 : TheoryFamily) : Prop :=
SIG 115:   (∀ (O : Type) [Fintype O] [DecidableEq O] (F : O → Matrix A A ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] Matrix A A ℂ),
SIG 116:     T.avail O F ↔ (𝒯 A).avail O F)
SIG 117:   ∧ ∀ (N : ℕ), 0 < N → ∀ (O : Type) [Fintype O] [DecidableEq O]
SIG 118:       (F : O → Matrix (A × Fin N) (A × Fin N) ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] Matrix (A × Fin N) (A × Fin N) ℂ),
SIG 119:       T.availExt N O F ↔ (𝒯 A).availExt N O F
=== EmbeddedObservation.lean:123 def EmbeddedObservation  HEADLINE
DOC 121: /-- **EMBEDDED OBSERVATION**: `T` is the ambient member of a regrouping- and
DOC 122: relabelling-invariant family of finite operational theories on all finite carriers. -/
