=== SpectatorBridge.lean:396 def HCompRealized  HEADLINE
DOC 392: /-- **`H_comp` REALIZED IN A THEORY.** The completion satisfies `H_comp`, and every coherent
DOC 393: map it names is an available one-outcome intervention: each letter on the composite
DOC 394: `R × (Fin 2 × Fin n)`, transported along `e` into the carrier at level `m`; each `B`-side
DOC 395: map at level `n`; each spectator-extended map at level `m`. -/
