=== QuasilocalAlgebra.lean:364 theorem emb_eq_iff  HEADLINE
DOC 361: /-- **THE EQUIVALENCE-CLASS THEOREM**: two finite-region observables have the same operator
DOC 362: exactly when they agree after inclusion into a common region. The local algebra is therefore
DOC 363: the algebra of equivalence classes of finite-region observables. -/
SIG 364: theorem emb_eq_iff [Nonempty Q] {Λ Λ' : Finset ι} (X : Matrix (Conf Λ Q) (Conf Λ Q) ℂ)
SIG 365:     (Y : Matrix (Conf Λ' Q) (Conf Λ' Q) ℂ) :
SIG 366:     emb Λ X = emb Λ' Y
SIG 367:       ↔ inclObs Finset.subset_union_left X = inclObs Finset.subset_union_right Y := by
