=== QuasilocalAlgebra.lean:684 def stage
DOC 683: /-- The finite stage embedded in the quasilocal algebra, as a star algebra homomorphism. -/
SIG 684: noncomputable def stage (Λ : Finset ι) :
SIG 685:     Matrix (Conf Λ Q) (Conf Λ Q) ℂ →⋆ₐ[ℂ] Quasilocal ι Q where
SIG 686:   toFun X := ((ofM Λ X : localAlg ι Q) : Quasilocal ι Q)
