SIG 1324: def hatIter (Φ : ReversibleDynamics ι Q) (Λ : Finset ι) : ℕ → Finset ι
SIG 1325:   | 0 => Λ
SIG 1326:   | k + 1 => hat Φ (hatIter Φ Λ k)
=== QuasilocalAlgebra.lean:1330 theorem heis_iterate_emb  HEADLINE
DOC 1328: /-- **THE ALGEBRAIC CAUSAL CONE**: after `k` steps a local observable of `Λ` is a local
DOC 1329: observable of the `k`-fold hat region. -/
