=== QuasilocalCharacterization.lean:168 structure QuasilocalSystem  HEADLINE
DOC 163: /-- **THE TARGET CLASS**: a discrete quasilocal lattice C*-system with the given local stages.
DOC 164: A C*-algebra with, for every finite region, a unital star homomorphism from the matrix algebra
DOC 165: of the region's configurations, compatible along inclusions, injective, with observables of
DOC 166: disjoint regions commuting, and with the union of the stages dense. Nothing here refers to the
DOC 167: scaffold, the local algebra, or the completion of the third entry. -/
SIG 168: structure QuasilocalSystem where
SIG 169:   /-- The algebra. -/
SIG 170:   A : Type
SIG 171:   [inst : CStarAlgebra A]
SIG 172:   /-- The stage embeddings. -/
SIG 173:   st : ∀ Λ : Finset ι, Matrix (Conf Λ Q) (Conf Λ Q) ℂ →⋆ₐ[ℂ] A
SIG 174:   compat : ∀ (Λ Λ' : Finset ι) (h : Λ ⊆ Λ') (X : Matrix (Conf Λ Q) (Conf Λ Q) ℂ),
SIG 175:     st Λ' (inclObs h X) = st Λ X
SIG 176:   injective : ∀ Λ, Function.Injective (st Λ)
SIG 177:   local_comm : ∀ (Λ Λ' : Finset ι), Disjoint Λ Λ' →
SIG 178:     ∀ (X : Matrix (Conf Λ Q) (Conf Λ Q) ℂ) (Y : Matrix (Conf Λ' Q) (Conf Λ' Q) ℂ),
SIG 179:       st Λ X * st Λ' Y = st Λ' Y * st Λ X
SIG 180:   dense : closure (⋃ Λ : Finset ι, Set.range (st Λ)) = Set.univ
=== QuasilocalCharacterization.lean:187 def oiSystem  HEADLINE
DOC 186: /-- **THE OI REGION COMPLETION IS A SYSTEM OF THE TARGET CLASS.** -/
SIG 187: noncomputable def oiSystem [Nonempty Q] : QuasilocalSystem ι Q where
SIG 188:   A := Quasilocal ι Q
SIG 189:   st := stage
SIG 190:   compat := fun _ _ h X => stage_inclObs h X
SIG 191:   injective := stage_injective
SIG 192:   local_comm := fun _ _ hd X Y => stage_comm_of_disjoint hd X Y
SIG 193:   dense := closure_iUnion_stage
=== QuasilocalCharacterization.lean:196 def IsState
DOC 195: /-- A state of a C*-algebra: a unital positive continuous functional. -/
SIG 196: def IsState {A : Type} [CStarAlgebra A] (ω : A →L[ℂ] ℂ) : Prop :=
SIG 197:   ω 1 = 1 ∧ ∀ x, 0 ≤ ω (star x * x)
