DOC 788: /-- **TARGET B IS NOT REDUNDANT**: the phase automorphism is a locality-preserving star
DOC 789: automorphism of the quasilocal algebra that is induced by no reversible finite-range substratum
DOC 790: dynamics. On a single-site matrix unit it produces the factor `I`, whereas every transported
DOC 791: matrix has real entries. -/
