SIG 345: theorem ruleDynamics_comp :
SIG 346:     (ruleDynamics R).φ = (shearDyn R).φ.trans (swapDyn V).φ := rfl
=== SecondOrderDrive.lean:351 theorem heisQ_ruleDynamics  HEADLINE
DOC 348: /-- **THE UPDATE'S HEISENBERG ACTION RUNS THE SWAP FIRST.** The order theorem of Section A applied
DOC 349: to the update's own factorization: this is the shape any two-piece drive for `heisQ` has to have,
DOC 350: and it is the shape `driveQ` has. -/
SIG 351: theorem heisQ_ruleDynamics (x : Quasilocal ι (V × V)) :
SIG 352:     heisQ (ruleDynamics R) x = heisQ (shearDyn R) (heisQ (swapDyn V) x) :=
