=== SecondOrderDrive.lean:435 theorem permOp_localDyn  HEADLINE
DOC 431: /-- **THE PERMUTATION OPERATOR OF A REGION-SUPPORTED DYNAMICS IS A LOCAL OPERATOR**, namely the
DOC 432: embedded permutation matrix of the region's permutation. This is the bridge between the scaffold
DOC 433: picture, where the dynamics permutes global configurations, and the algebra picture, where it is
DOC 434: conjugation by an element of one region's stage. -/
