=== SecondOrderDrive.lean:595 theorem swapQ_one_eq_heisQ  HEADLINE
DOC 591: /-- **THE SWAP LAYER'S ENDPOINT.** At time one the swap flow is exactly the Heisenberg action of
DOC 592: the swap dynamics on the quasilocal algebra. The identification is made on staged local
DOC 593: observables, where both sides are conjugation by the same region's permutation matrix, and
DOC 594: extended by continuity. -/
