SIG 220:     (Φ (Eu i i)).IsHermitian ∧ Φ (Eu i i) * Φ (Eu i i) = Φ (Eu i i) := by
=== JordanClassification.lean:227 theorem image_diag_orth
DOC 226: /-- The images of distinct diagonal units are orthogonal. -/
