DOC 239: /-- The images of the diagonal units resolve the identity. -/
SIG 240: theorem image_diag_sum (Φ : Matrix n n ℂ →ₗ[ℂ] Matrix n n ℂ) (hone : Φ 1 = 1) :
SIG 241:     ∑ i, Φ (Eu i i) = 1 := by
