SIG 398:     (horm : ∀ i j, star (v i) ⬝ᵥ v j = if i = j then 1 else 0) (i j k l : n) :
SIG 399:     qd v i j * qd v k l = (if j = k then (1 : ℂ) else 0) • qd v i l := by
=== JordanClassification.lean:403 theorem qd_conjTranspose
SIG 403: theorem qd_conjTranspose (v : n → n → ℂ) (i j : n) : (qd v i j)ᴴ = qd v j i := by
