=== OperationalRigidity.lean:602 theorem extreme_projection  HEADLINE
DOC 599: /-- **An extreme point of the operator interval is a projection**: a Hermitian element of
DOC 600: `[0, 1]` admitting no Hermitian perturbation has spectrum in `{0, 1}`, by the explicit
DOC 601: perturbation `λ(1−λ)` along its eigenframe. -/
SIG 602: theorem extreme_projection {P : Matrix n n ℂ} (hPh : P.IsHermitian)
SIG 603:     (h0 : P.PosSemidef) (h1 : ((1 : Matrix n n ℂ) - P).PosSemidef)
SIG 604:     (hext : ∀ Z : Matrix n n ℂ, Z.IsHermitian →
SIG 605:       (P + Z).PosSemidef → ((1 : Matrix n n ℂ) - (P + Z)).PosSemidef →
SIG 606:       (P - Z).PosSemidef → ((1 : Matrix n n ℂ) - (P - Z)).PosSemidef → Z = 0) :
SIG 607:     P * P = P := by
