=== OperationalRigidity.lean:647 structure OrderIsoHyp  HEADLINE
DOC 643: /-- **The order-isomorphism hypothesis package**: a unital ℝ-linear star-preserving
DOC 644: bijection of the matrix algebra, positive in BOTH directions. The two-sided positivity
DOC 645: is Kadison's `X ⪰ 0 ⟺ Φ(X) ⪰ 0`; probe F18's pinching countercontrol shows one-sided
DOC 646: positivity does not suffice for the Jordan conclusion. -/
SIG 647: structure OrderIsoHyp (Φ Ψ : Matrix n n ℂ → Matrix n n ℂ) : Prop where
SIG 648:   add : ∀ X Y, Φ (X + Y) = Φ X + Φ Y
SIG 649:   smul : ∀ (r : ℝ) (X : Matrix n n ℂ), Φ (r • X) = r • Φ X
SIG 650:   star : ∀ X, Φ Xᴴ = (Φ X)ᴴ
SIG 651:   one : Φ 1 = 1
SIG 652:   pos : ∀ X, X.PosSemidef → (Φ X).PosSemidef
SIG 653:   posInv : ∀ X, X.PosSemidef → (Ψ X).PosSemidef
SIG 654:   left : ∀ X, Ψ (Φ X) = X
SIG 655:   right : ∀ X, Φ (Ψ X) = X
