=== OperationalRigidity.lean:671 theorem neg
SIG 671: theorem neg (h : OrderIsoHyp Φ Ψ) (X : Matrix n n ℂ) : Φ (-X) = -Φ X := by
=== OperationalRigidity.lean:677 theorem sub
SIG 677: theorem sub (h : OrderIsoHyp Φ Ψ) (X Y : Matrix n n ℂ) : Φ (X - Y) = Φ X - Φ Y := by
