=== PassiveIndependence.lean:335 theorem sector_diagram  HEADLINE
DOC 332: /-- **OI-N4, the sector diagram.** On both sides of the OI-core line the same pattern holds:
DOC 333: passively complete on the commutative sector, passively incomplete on the full algebra. What
DOC 334: passive (in)completeness tracks is the sector, and the OI status does not move it. -/
SIG 335: theorem sector_diagram :
SIG 336:     (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 337:         OICore T ∧ PassivelyCompleteOnDiagonal T ∧ PassivelyIncomplete T)
SIG 338:     ∧ (∃ T : FiniteOperationalTheory (Fin 2),
SIG 339:         ¬ OICore T ∧ PassivelyCompleteOnDiagonal T ∧ PassivelyIncomplete T) :=
