=== PassiveQuotient.lean:240 def PassivelyMinimal  HEADLINE
DOC 237: /-- **Passive minimality**: no nontrivial quotient preserves the complete passive
DOC 238: visible history — every observation-preserving congruence is trivial. This is
DOC 239: minimality of the REPRESENTATION, not minimal ontic reality. -/
SIG 240: def PassivelyMinimal (φ : Equiv.Perm S) (vis : S → I) : Prop :=
SIG 241:   ∀ r : S → S → Prop, ObservationCongruence φ vis r → ∀ s t, r s t → s = t
